  "description": "Persistent memory, architectural decisions, and safety guardrails for Claude Code. Your agent starts every session with full project context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `axme`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install axme-code@claude-community` from `AxmeAI/axme-code-plugin`.\n\nPersistent memory, architectural decisions, and safety guardrails for Claude Code. Your agent starts every session with full project context — stack, decisions, patterns, safety rules, and a handoff from the previous session.",
